{
  "zh-CN": {
    "Goku": "Goku",
    "And so he left, hungry for more.": "于是他离开了，渴望着更多挑战。",
    "Default": "默认",
    "Goku Black": "黑悟空",
    "Drip": "潮牌",
    "Saiyan Blood": "赛亚人血统",
    "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Kaioken Transformation</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>C</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "使用技能还需要消耗<color=#03bcff>气</color>！\n轻按<color=#03f4fc>C</color>进行<color=#FF5400>主变身</color>（更多信息请查看“变身”标签页）。\n长按<color=#03f4fc>C</color>进行<color=#FF5400>界王拳变身</color>。\n轻按<color=#03f4fc>X</color><color=#FF5400>解除变身</color>。\n长按<color=#03f4fc>跳跃</color>进行<color=#FF5400>飞行</color>。",
    "Melee Strike": "近战打击",
    "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Teleports instead if </color><color=#FF5400>Kaioken</color><color=#03f4fc> is active!</color>": "每次攻击造成<color=#E5C962>280%伤害</color>！\n每次命中获得<color=#03bcff>9%气</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>自动朝目标敌人移动。</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>若处于</color><color=#FF5400>界王拳</color><color=#03f4fc>状态则改为瞬间移动！</color>",
    "Triple Kick (Legacy)": "三连踢（旧版）",
    "Unleashes a trio of kicks! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>260% Damage</color> each!\nGain <color=#03bcff>5% Ki</color> Per Hit!": "施展三连踢！\n每一击造成<color=#E5C962>260%伤害</color>！\n每次命中获得<color=#03bcff>5%气</color>！",
    "Ki Blast": "气弹",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>6 Ki</color>\nFire off a speedy Ki Blast! \n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill fires an additional blast </color>\nDealing <color=#E5C962>350% Damage</color> for each one!\n": "消耗<color=#03bcff>6气</color>\n快速发射一颗气弹！\n<color=#03f4fc>按住此技能可额外发射一颗气弹</color>\n每一击造成<color=#E5C962>350%伤害</color>！\n",
    "Meteor Crash": "流星崩溃",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nRapidly unleash a barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>340% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>20气</color>\n迅速施展一连串连续打击！\n每一击造成<color=#E5C962>340%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>按住此技能每秒消耗</color><color=#03bcff>10%气</color><color=#03f4fc>。</color>",
    "Instant Transmission": "瞬间移动",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>25 Ki</color>\nFocus on your target and teleport!\n<color=#03f4fc>Distance is limited if there is no target</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>25气</color>\n锁定目标并瞬间移动！\n<color=#03f4fc>若无目标则移动距离受限</color>",
    "Ki Charge": "气力充能",
    "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second\n<color=#03f4fc>Mitigates strain, allowing for extended Kaioken usage.</color>": "按住以每秒恢复<color=#03bcff>20%气</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>缓解身体负担，从而延长界王拳的使用时间。</color>",
    "Kamehameha": "龟派气功",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>30气</color>\n蓄力并释放龟派气功，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>1200%伤害</color>！\n消耗额外气，每蓄力一秒使伤害提高<color=#E5C962>1000%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>蓄力越久，气的消耗逐渐增加！</color>",
    "Spirit Bomb": "元气弹",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Spirit Bomb, Dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color> per 0.3 seconds to enemies within it! \nConsume additional Ki and increase overall damage by <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>If the Spirit Bomb collides with a boss or the ground, it will explode, Dealing </color><color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color>\n<color=#999999>Gain Bonus Armor whilst standing still.</color>\n<color=#FF0000>Whilst moving the Spirit Bomb will not charge!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>200气</color>\n凝聚并释放元气弹，对其中的敌人每0.3秒造成<color=#E5C962>400%伤害</color>！\n消耗额外气，每蓄力一秒使总体伤害提高<color=#E5C962>1200%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>蓄力越久，气的消耗逐渐增加！</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>若元气弹碰撞到Boss或地面，将会发生爆炸，造成</color><color=#E5C962>4000%伤害</color>\n<color=#999999>静止站立时获得额外护甲。</color>\n<color=#FF0000>移动时元气弹将无法蓄力！</color>",
    "Angry Kamehameha": "愤怒龟派气功",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Angry Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1550% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>60气</color>\n释放愤怒龟派气功，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>1550%伤害</color>！",
    "Ki Blast Barrage": "连续气功弹",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Barrage of Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>205% Damage</color> with each one!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>80气</color>\n释放漫天连续气弹，每一发造成<color=#E5C962>205%伤害</color>！",
    "Dragon Fist": "龙拳",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>225 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2400% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>225气</color>\n向前冲锋并释放炽烈龙拳，对命中的所有敌人造成<color=#E5C962>2400%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>对低生命值目标造成额外伤害！</color>",
    "God Bind": "神之拘束",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>150 Ki</color>\nChannel the Saiyan God's power and deal <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> and stun per pulse!\n<color=#03f4fc>Extend the duration at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>10 Ki per second!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>150气</color>\n引导赛亚人之神的力量，每次脉冲造成<color=#E5C962>800%伤害</color>并眩晕敌人！\n<color=#03f4fc>可延长持续时间，消耗为每秒</color><color=#03bcff>10气！</color>",
    "God Fist Kamehameha": "神拳龟派气功",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and Unleash a God Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nThen continuing with a God Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> to each enemy hit!": "消耗<color=#03bcff>300气</color>\n蓄力并释放神龟派气功，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>4000%伤害</color>！\n随后接续神拳重击，对命中的每个敌人造成<color=#E5C962>1200%伤害</color>！",
    "Godly Display": "神越演武",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nrapidly teleport and strike all nearby enemies dealing <color=#E5C962>600% Damage</color>!\nFinishes off with a powerful roar dealing <color=#E5C962>2000% Damage</color> to all nearby enemies!\n<color=#03f4fc>The number of strikes increases based on attack speed</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>400气</color>\n极速瞬间移动并打击附近所有敌人，造成<color=#E5C962>600%伤害</color>！\n最后以强力咆哮收尾，对附近所有敌人造成<color=#E5C962>2000%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>攻击次数随攻击速度提升</color>",
    "Kamehameha x10": "10倍龟派气功",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a powerful Kamehameha x10, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1300% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>60气</color>\n蓄力并释放强大的10倍龟派气功，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>1300%伤害</color>！\n消耗额外气，每蓄力一秒使伤害提高<color=#E5C962>1400%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>蓄力越久，气的消耗逐渐增加！</color>",
    "Black Kamehameha": "黑暗龟派气功",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a godly Black Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>70气</color>\n蓄力并释放神明般的黑暗龟派气功，光束持续期间每秒造成<color=#E5C962>1700%伤害</color>！\n消耗额外气，每蓄力一秒使伤害提高<color=#E5C962>1000%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>蓄力越久，气的消耗逐渐增加！</color>",
    "White Dragon Fist": "白龙拳",
    "Costs <color=#03bcff>350 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4200% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "消耗<color=#03bcff>350气</color>\n向前冲锋并释放炽烈龙拳，对命中的所有敌人造成<color=#E5C962>4200%伤害</color>！\n<color=#03f4fc>对低生命值目标造成额外伤害！</color>",
    "DuoFinalKamehamehaSkill": "双人最终龟派气功",
